Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，我该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Marcel. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来，马塞尔，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:28.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we're gonna go take a bath. Yes, we are, aren't we? Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:28.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要去洗澡 对不对  对啊 我们要洗澡哦 好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're still just friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:31.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们仍然只是朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I will see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. You're gonna spend tomorrow at Aunt Rachel's, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 明天你要来 瑞秋阿姨这边 对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, hang on. Does Aunt Monica get a say in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，等一下 摩妮卡阿姨有没有权利说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:46.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, Aunt Monica, please? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:46.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托啦  摩妮卡阿姨  好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, unclench. You're not even gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，放轻松 明天你根本就不在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（乔G披萨店）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: I can't believe we're having this discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信我们居然在讨论这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:01.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I agree. I'm, like, in disbelief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:01.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同意，我也不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:05.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you think if things were gonna happen with Rachel, they would've happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:05.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得你跟瑞秋如果能在一起 早就在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:08.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, she said she's looking for a relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:08.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你们 她说她想要跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with someone exactly like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像我这样的人谈恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She really said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I added the "exactly like me" part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝像我这样的人〞是我自己加的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:20.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she said she's looking for someone. And someone is gonna be there tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:20.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是她说她在找个好男人 好男人今晚就会出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Tonight" tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝今晚〞 你是说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I think it's perfect. It's just gonna be the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想这一定会很完美 就只有我们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She spent all day taking care of my monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她整天都在照顾我的猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't remember the last time I got a girl to take care of my monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.85,0:05:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不记得上次有女生 照顾我的猴子是什么时候的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:42.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, you know, I figured after work, I'd go pick up a bottle of wine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:42.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正，下班后 我去买一瓶酒…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...go over there and, uh, try to woo her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后过去开始追求她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:49.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know what you should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:49.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道你应该怎么做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:53.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should take her back to the 1890s when that phrase was last used.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:53.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该带她回19世纪末 当时还有人使用那种字眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you keep this up...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你坚持下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll be finished with this sucker by the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不到周末，那个浑蛋就玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, the one in the feathered boa, that's Dr. Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个围着羽绒围巾的是 法兰西斯医生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, she used to be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她以前是个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:12.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look. See, now, there's Raven. We hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:12.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看，那是瑞文 我们讨厌她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're glad she's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很高兴她快死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then... What? Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后…怎么了 马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you playing with Monica's shoes? You know you're not supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在玩摩妮卡阿姨的鞋子吗？ 你知道你不可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，哇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:26.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcel, did you poo in the shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:26.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔 你大便在鞋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Marcel. Bad monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔，坏猴子 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，巴瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little engagement gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 点祝贺你订婚的小礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:44.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure you didn't register for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:44.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你的礼物清单上没有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who died? Who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.35,0:06:54.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁死了  谁死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Roll him over. Oh, come on, roll him over. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把他翻过来 快点，把他翻过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we know it wasn't Dexter, right, Marcel? Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们知道那不是德柯斯特 对不对，马塞尔？因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:06.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcel? Marcel? Marc...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:06.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔 马塞尔 马…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How could you lose him? - I don't know, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你怎么可能把他弄丢了？ - 不知道，我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were watching TV, and then he pooped in Monica's shoe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在看电视 然后他大便在摩妮卡的鞋子里…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:17.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. He pooped in my shoe? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:17.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 他大便在我的鞋子里  哪一只
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. The left one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道，左脚那一只
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Which ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪一双
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, those little clunky Amish things you think go with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是那双你认为百搭的笨重黑鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. GROUP: Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:31.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa, oh. Why is the air in here so negative?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:31.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么空气中充满了负面情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Rachel lost Marcel. - Oh, no. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 瑞秋把马塞尔弄丢了 - 噢，不会吧，怎么弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:39.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He pooped in my shoe. - Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:39.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他大便在我的鞋子里  - 那一只
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those cute little black ones I wear all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:41.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我常穿的那双可爱黑鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, which one? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是，是哪一只
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The right or left?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}右脚还是左脚？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because the left one is lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为左脚的话，代表幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:50.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, you guys. What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:50.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大伙儿，拜托 我该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, all right, all right. You're a monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，好吧 你是一只猴子…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're loose in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在城市里走失了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where do you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's his first time out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，这是他第一次出门…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:02.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so he's probably gonna want to do some of the touristy things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:02.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以他可能会去 一些观光景点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll go to Cats. You go to the Russian Tea Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去《猫》音乐剧那边找 你们去俄国茶坊找
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊！拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's gonna be home any minute. He's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他马上就回来，他会杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Start with the building. You take the first and second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.35,0:08:16.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先从这栋房子开始 你们去1楼和2楼找
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe and I will take third and fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比跟我去3楼跟4楼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:20.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa, whoa. What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:20.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，那我怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you stay here and just wait by the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，你留在这里等电话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:26.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spray Lysol in my shoe and wait for Ross to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:26.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我的鞋子里喷清洁剂 等罗斯回来杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:29.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does anybody want to trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:29.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人要跟我交换工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Heckles, our friend lost a monkey. Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}黑考斯先生，我们朋友的 猴子走丢了，你有没有看到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I left a Belgian waffle out here. Did you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把格子松饼放在外头 是不是你们拿走的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:45.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:45.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you leave your Belgian waffle in the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:48.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要把格子松饼 放在走道里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wasn't ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还没准备好要吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:52.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The monkey, have you seen a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:52.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猴子，你有没有看到猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I saw Regis Philbin once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:55.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我见过主持人瑞吉斯一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Mr. Heckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你，黑考斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You owe me a waffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们欠我一块松饼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, he's a black capuchin monkey with a white face...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，是一只白脸的黑色僧帽猴…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:10.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with Russian dressing and pickles on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:10.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}俄式沙拉酱跟腌黄瓜 另外放一边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. - Hey. How did it go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嘿，今天还可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, great. It went great. Really great. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.20,0:09:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 噢，好极了，顺利到不行 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, is that wine? - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿，你带酒来  - 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You, uh, want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要喝一些吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, I would love some. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 噢，我很想喝 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:27.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you know what? You know what? Let's not drink it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:27.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好了，这样好了 我们不要在这里喝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm feeling kind of crazy. Do you want to go to Newark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:30.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我突然想疯一下 你要不要去纽华克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:36.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:36.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:40.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could do that. But before we head off to the murder capital of the Northeast...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:40.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们当然可以去那里 但在去东北部的谋杀案首都前…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I was, uh, kind of wanted to run something by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想先跟你谈一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:47.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how we were, you know, talking before...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:47.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我们先前谈过的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...about relationships and stuff, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有关恋爱之类的话题…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:54.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, God, Ross, I cannot do this. - Okay, quick and painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:54.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 噢，天啊，罗斯，我不能这么做 - 好吧，迅速而痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, all right. All right, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，好吧，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, please don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，请不要恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, what? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，怎么了 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道，马塞尔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah? - Well, ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么  - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:23.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I kind of, uh... I kind of lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:23.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好像把他弄丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:39.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:39.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:43.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, all I asked you to do was keep him in the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:43.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是要你看着他 别让他离开这间公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，我知道，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I guess it's partially my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗 我想我也有错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I shouldn't have asked you to start off with a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不应该一开始就请你照顾猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should have started you off with, like, a pen or a pencil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该一开始就请你看着 一支铅笔之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:55.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, I'm doing everything that I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:55.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，我已经在尽力找了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got everybody looking for him and I got...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都在找他，而且我还…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.89,0:11:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Who is it? LUISA [OVER INTERCOM]: Animal Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.89,0:11:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 哪一位  - 动物紧急救援小组
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- See, I've even got Animal Control. - You called Animal Control?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你看，我还打电话给动物紧急救援 - 你打电话给动物紧急救援
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯哼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:12.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Do you not like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:12.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了 你不喜欢他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:19.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. Marcel is an illegal exotic animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:19.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔是非法引进的外来动物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not allowed to have him in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能在城市里养
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If they find him, they'll take him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们一旦找到他 就会把他从我身边带走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:31.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, now, see, you never ever, ever told us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:31.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，这样说好了 你从来没有告诉过我们这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right, because I didn't expect you we're gonna invite them to the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，因为我没想到 你会邀请他们来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:42.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好，谢谢你赶过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somebody called about a monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是有人打电话 问猴子怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Oh, you know what? That was a complete misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，你知道吗 那完全是个误会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, we thought we had a monkey, but we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对啊，我们以为 我们看到一只猴子，结果不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It turned out it was a hat. - Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:52.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那是顶帽子 - 猫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:54.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cat. What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:54.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猫，我刚刚说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. We checked the third and fourth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}3楼跟4楼 我们都去看过了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No one's seen Marcel. - Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有人看到马塞尔 - 马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My uncle Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:11:59.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叔叔马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, is that who the monkey's named after?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，猴子的名字就是这样来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you aware that possession of an illegal exotic is punishable...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道私自豢养 非法引进的外来动物…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by up to two years in prison and confiscation of the animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最高可罚到2年牢狱 动物没收
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:12.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd put that poor little creature in jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们会把可怜的小动物 关在牢里2年？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:25.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, you remember how we talked about saying things quietly to yourself first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:25.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，记不记得我们说过 说话前要先想一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but there isn't always time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得，不过不是随时 都有时间可以这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:36.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm sure there's some friendly way to reconcile this. Um, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:36.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信一定有更友善的方式解决 你先请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}First of all, we haven't been introduced. I'm Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还没自我介绍 我是摩妮卡·盖勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，天啊，是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- And you're Rachel Green. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 而你是瑞秋·葛林 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luisa Gianetti. Lincoln High?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}露伊莎·基雅内蒂 我也是林肯高中毕业的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sat behind you guys in homeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每次在教室上课时 我都坐在你们后面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:55.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! Luisa. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:55.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}露伊莎，噢，我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica. It's Luisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡，是露伊莎耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:00.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luisa. From homeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:00.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同间教室的露伊莎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:05.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You have no idea who I am, do you? RACHEL: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:05.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你根本不知道我是谁，对不对  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:11.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe that's because you spent four years ignoring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:11.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许是因为整整4年  你正眼都没瞧过我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would it have been so hard to say, "Morning, Luisa"...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说句〝早安，露伊莎〞，还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or "Nice overalls"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝好可爱的吊带裤〞 有那么难吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:28.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not so much you. You were fat. You had your own problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:28.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不怪你，你那时候很胖 问题已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:33.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you. What a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你，真是个讨人厌的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:39.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? Be that as it may.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:39.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好了，过去就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:43.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think you could you help us out here on that monkey thing, for old times' sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:43.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看在过去的份上，猴子的事 能不能请你帮个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go, Bobcats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加油，山猫队
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.35,0:13:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could. But I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.35,0:13:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以，但是我不帮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I find that monkey, he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}猴子被我找到，就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Da, da, da
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哒 哒 哒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:13:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:13:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHANDLER: Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Marcel? - Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 马塞尔？ - 马塞尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.21,0:14:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.21,0:14:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，有什么事我可以帮忙的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:24.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, we're kind of having an emergency, and, ahem, we were looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:24.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有点紧急状况 我们在找东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- A monkey. - Yes, have you seen any?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 找猴子 - 对，你有没有看到一只猴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:31.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, I haven't seen a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:31.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有，我没看到什么猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:33.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know anything about fixing radiators?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:33.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们会不会修理暖气炉？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, sure. Did you try turning the knob back the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:36.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然，你们有没有试着 把开关往相反方向转？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Of course. - Oh. Then, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 当然有 - 那我们就没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Taste this daiquiri. Is there too much rum in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你尝尝这鸡尾酒 莱姆酒会不会放太多？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a second. Hope you find your monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，希望你们快点找到猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, wait. No, no, no. Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，不，等一下等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, we may not know about radiators, per se...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}暖气炉我们可能不太熟悉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but we do have a certain amount of expertise...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我们对环境的冷暖…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the heating and cooling milieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一定程度的认知
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:05.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, weren't we kind of in the middle of something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:05.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不是还有事情要做吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but these women are very hot and they need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，但是这些女人很热 而且需要我们帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they're very hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且还很辣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不可以这样，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have no idea how sorry. But we promised we'd find this monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不知道我们有多遗憾 但是我们已经答应要去找猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you see him, he's about yea high and answers to the name Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们看到他，他大概这么高 叫他马塞尔他会回应
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if we could get some pictures of you, you'd really be helping us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我们能够有你们的照片 那对我们帮助很大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, from now on, you don't get to talk to other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，从现在开始 你不准跟外人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Marcel? - Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:44.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 马塞尔？ - 马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:45.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（危险，高压电）
