Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Marcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马塞尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, my God. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 噢，天啊 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:53.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something just brushed up against my right leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:53.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有东西拂过我的右腿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What is it? - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:58.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's okay. It was just my left leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:58.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，没什么 那是我的左腿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Look, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看，菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Oh, Marcel. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，太好了 噢，马塞尔，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, come here, Marcel. - Step aside, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 过来，马塞尔 - 两位小姐，请让开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:10.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you gonna do? - Just a small tranquilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:10.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你要做什么？ - 只是一点镇静剂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Run, Marcel, run! Run, Marcel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快跑，马塞尔，快跑！ 跑啊，马塞尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Damn. - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 该死 - 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，还好，应该没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
