Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:54.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS & RACHEL: Marcel. Marcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:54.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 马塞尔 - 马塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:56.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is ridiculous. We've been all over the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:56.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太荒谬了 我们整个社区都找过了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's gone. He's just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:58.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跑掉了，他跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross, you don't know that. - Oh, come on. It's cold, it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 罗斯，你怎么知道？ - 噢，拜托，现在又冷又暗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He doesn't know the Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他根本不熟悉格林威治村
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:06.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now I have a broken foot. Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:06.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我的脚骨断了 噢，我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:09.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have no monkey and a broken foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:09.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的猴子不见了，再加上断脚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, you know, I've said I'm sorry, like, a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯，我已经跟你 道歉过几百万次了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:17.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want me to do? Huh? You want me to break my foot too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:17.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我怎么做  你要我也踢断脚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, I'm gonna break my foot right now. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧，我也来踢断我的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:23.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. There, are you happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:23.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢，天啊 好了，这样你高兴了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah. You know, now that you kicked the sign...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有，有 你踢过交通标志后…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...hey, ha, ha, I don't miss Marcel anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，我突然不再想念马塞尔了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:34.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's not like I did this on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:34.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂，我又不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:37.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. No, no. This is just vintage Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:37.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不，当然不是 这只是标准的瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:40.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, things just sort of happen around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你身边的倒楣事都会自动发生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:43.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you're off in Rachel Land, doing your Rachel thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:43.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一直都活在自己的世界里 做你自己的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...totally oblivious to people's monkeys or to people's feelings and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全不顾别人的猴子 还是别人的感受…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I don't even want to hear it. - Ross.
